    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the forward cargo door latching installation, showing the latch beam, the eight latch pin housing sets and the harness retention hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the forward cargo door latching installation, from the latch beam outward to the eight latch pin housings and the retention hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the latch beam with the door open, viewed from inside the compartment. Item 20 is the latch pin housing set: the bushing, the latch pin and the retention ring are catalogued as one matched group of eight and are supplied together. A single bushing may be ordered against the set reference where only the bushing is being renewed. The cable ties at item 60 secure the door harness along the beam."
    },
